Description:
  Generates (but does not run) a migration adding remote_updated_at to the table of a shadow model: Takamaru::Shadowable
  then skips the responses older than the remote record already applied. See Shadow models section in README.md.

Example:
  rails generate takamaru:shadow_version User

  This will create:
    db/migrate/XXXXXXXXXXXXXX_add_remote_updated_at_to_users.rb
